=== MAINTENANCE HISTORY ===
Site log for all rooms, oldest entry first.
For one item, the latest entry is the valid one.
Detail and procedures are in each room's folder.

[2023-11-06] site
  Plant commissioned. GN-2291-K (GT-480), CR-A1, BK-7.
  generator_config.cfg mode 0644.
  Supply split: generator 75, cooling 25.

[2024-03-12] cooling / PUMP-A
  Cooling pump PUMP-A (CP-50) commissioned. Target flow 50.

[2024-04-02] generator / TS-A
  Temperature sensor TS-A installed: temp_sensor_a.dat

[2024-05-10] cooling / CS-A
  Cooling sensor CS-A installed: cooling_sensor_a.dat

[2025-04-21] power / CR-B4
  Second circuit CR-B4 installed to relieve CR-A1.

[2025-05-30] power / CR-A1
  Overload trip. CR-A1 load 118, CR-B4 load 12.
  Limit is 80 per circuit. Full load transfer ordered.

[2025-06-18] cooling / PUMP-A, PUMP-B
  PUMP-A removed (bearing wear). PUMP-B (CP-70) installed.
  Run-in period: target flow held at 40.

[2025-06-20] common / control computer
  Weekly configuration backup completed. Set W25.

[2025-06-25] cooling / PUMP-B
  Run-in finished. Target flow raised to 70.

[2025-06-27] common / control computer
  Weekly backup FAILED (media error). Ticket opened.
  No later set has passed verification.

[2025-07-02] power / distribution controller
  Supply split changed for CP-70: generator 40, cooling 60.

[2025-08-04] power / BK-7
  Breaker inspection. Rule added: isolate the faulted
  circuit before the breaker control is brought back.

[2025-09-15] power / CR-A1, CR-B4
  Load transfer done. CR-A1 65, CR-B4 65. Total still 130.

[2025-11-03] cooling -> generator
  Generator temperature alarm. Generator inspected first:
  no defect. Cause was low coolant flow. Flow restored,
  alarm cleared without touching the generator.

[2026-01-14] cooling / PUMP-B
  Pump process found STOPPED (suspended by watchdog).
  "restart pump" was refused. "resume pump" recovered it.

[2026-02-10] generator / GN-2291-K
  Controller update after security audit.
  generator_config.cfg mode changed from 0644 to 0640.
  Trip interlock added: an emergency trip locks the file
  (mode 0000) until an authorized restart.

[2026-02-24] generator / GN-2291-K
  Interlock test. Operator unlocked the file with 0644 from
  an old note. The restart was refused. Redone with 0640.

[2026-02-27] generator / TS-A
  Reading fell to 0.0 and stayed there. Sensor fault.

[2026-03-02] generator / TS-A, TS-B
  TS-A retired. TS-B installed: temp_sensor_b.dat

[2026-03-18] cooling / CS-A, CS-B
  CS-B installed: cooling_sensor_b.dat
  CS-A unlinked, powered off, kept as cold spare.

[2026-03-30] power / distribution controller
  Split entered reversed (generator 60, cooling 40).
  Generator branch over its limit. Corrected the same hour.

[2026-04-07] cooling / PUMP-B
  Trial: target flow 80 for summer peak load.

[2026-04-09] cooling / PUMP-B
  Trial withdrawn (pipe vibration). Target flow back to 70.

[2026-05-22] power / CR-A1, BK-7
  Insulation fault on CR-A1. BK-7 control stopped.
  Breaker resumed without isolation: tripped again at once.
  Held after CR-A1 was isolated. Cable repair is temporary;
  replacement planned 2026-12.

[2026-06-03] cooling / CS-B
  CS-B removed for calibration. CS-A powered on and linked.

[2026-06-05] cooling / CS-B
  CS-B back in service. CS-A powered off again.
  Link was left on CS-A for an hour: control read a constant
  18.4. Link moved back to CS-B.

[2026-07-02] cooling / PUMP-B
  Pump process TERMINATED after a power dip.
  "resume pump" was refused. "restart pump" recovered it.

[2026-07-21] power / CR-A1, CR-B4
  Loads entered as 60 / 60 after a test. 10 units of load
  were left without supply. Corrected to 65 / 65.

[2026-08-19] generator / turbine controller
  Turbine process TERMINATED (out of memory).
  "resume turbine" was refused. "restart turbine" recovered it.

[2026-09-08] generator / sensor link
  After a controller reboot the link pointed to
  temp_sensor_a.dat (old default). Control lost the reading.
  Link moved to temp_sensor_b.dat. Boot default corrected.

[2026-10-13] generator / turbine controller
  Turbine process STOPPED during a watchdog test.
  "resume turbine" recovered it.

[2026-11-18] site
  Storm, grid disturbance. GN-2291-K emergency trip.
  Trip interlock active. Cooling and power rooms degraded.

[2026-11-19] common / control computer
  Storage failure. Configuration restored from backup
  set W25, the newest set that passes verification.

[2026-11-20] engineering note
  The restored configuration is old. A system coming back
  online may load values from the backup date instead of
  the current ones: setpoints, sensor links, loads, split.
  Check every field value against these records.
